      "id": "E-DOCUMENTARY-DELTA-AC-02",
      "kind": "inspection",
      "command_or_method": "New documentary dependency comparison against exact preserved pre-edit inputs and unchanged scenario/consumer/oracle scope; historical executions not rerun.",
      "observed_result": "T004 checkbox/closure note now agrees with the already recorded four bounded consumer observations; scenario/spec, skill source, concrete consumer and oracle are unchanged. Recorded scope: Owned Linux temporary fixtures, static paths, cooperating cross-process writers and a single transaction. Exact bytes represent snapshots. Polling hint plus actual read. No hostile path replacement/noncooperating write-race guarantee, PID reuse recovery or power-loss durability. Recovery integration: the updated governance helper resolves authenticated documentary predecessors; the final governance suite and 439/439 recovery observation support that bounded change. These checks do not reaccept the 25 historical criteria or rerun product/skill consumers.",
